                    "text": "The shutdown is a direct result of Democrats refusing to pass clean funding bills that prioritize border security and military readiness. While Rep. Williams claims Republicans are threatening SNAP, the reality is her party is holding nutrition aid hostage to force through unrelated healthcare subsidies for undocumented immigrants.\n\nThe House already passed H.R. 5108 to fund SNAP through November, but Senate Democrats blocked it unless they get $12B for non-citizen medical coverage. This isn\u2019t about food security\u2014it\u2019s about using vulnerable Americans as political pawns.\n\nFund the government, secure the border, and stop manufacturing crises to justify reckless demands.\n\nSee the documented timeline and vote records for who\u2019s really blocking aid: https://t.co/nmis3sWFWQ",
